[en.IDEA_C12_BRIBE_IMPERIAL_OFFICIALS_TO_EMPIRE]
Bribery for Autonomy

[en.IDEA_C12_BRIBE_IMPERIAL_OFFICIALS_TO_EMPIRE_desc]
By bribing corrupt imperial officials and nobles, let them turn a blind eye to our growth and expansion until it’s too late for them to stop us, avoiding an early war with the Empire.

[zh.IDEA_C12_BRIBE_IMPERIAL_OFFICIALS_TO_EMPIRE]
自治献金

[zh.IDEA_C12_BRIBE_IMPERIAL_OFFICIALS_TO_EMPIRE_desc]
通过行贿腐败的帝国官员和贵族，让他们在发觉为时已晚前放任我们发展壮大，避免帝国提前与我们开战。
